// bar410_gameloop.yarn

// ================================================================
//  Step 1 + 2: Small talk → get order
// ================================================================

title: SmallTalkAndOrder
---
// <<declare>> must live inside a node, not outside
<<declare $satisfaction  = "Fail">>
<<declare $minigame_win  = false>>
<<declare $cocktail_type = "Any">>

Narrator: A customer walks up to the bar and sits down.

Alex: Hey there. Busy night, huh?

-> Yeah, pretty packed.
    Alex: Ha, tell me about it. I could really use a drink.
-> Slow night actually.
    Alex: Really? Seems lively to me.

Alex: Anyway, could I get something?

<<set_order "LowAlcohol">>

Alex: I'll have something to drink, please.

<<jump MakeCocktail>>
===

// ================================================================
//  Step 3: Making the cocktail
// ================================================================

title: MakeCocktail
---
Narrator: Time to make the drink. Add your ingredients, then shake or stir.

<<play_minigame "Shaking">>

<<if $minigame_win>>
    Narrator: A perfect shake!
<<else>>
    Narrator: That didn't feel quite right...
<<endif>>

<<jump ServeCocktail>>
===

// ================================================================
//  Step 3c + 4: Serve + reaction
// ================================================================

title: ServeCocktail
---
<<serve_cocktail>>

<<if $satisfaction == "Perfect">>
    <<jump React_Perfect>>
<<elseif $satisfaction == "Acceptable">>
    <<jump React_Acceptable>>
<<else>>
    <<jump React_Fail>>
<<endif>>
===

// ================================================================
//  Step 4: After-serve reactions
// ================================================================

title: React_Perfect
---
Alex: Wow. This is exactly what I needed. You're good at this.
Narrator: Alex looks genuinely impressed.
<<jump ContinueStory>>
===

title: React_Acceptable
---
Alex: Mm, not bad. Something's a little off, but it does the job.
Narrator: Alex takes another sip, looking thoughtful.
<<jump ContinueStory>>
===

title: React_Fail
---
Alex: Uh... I'm not sure this is right. Did you follow the recipe?
Narrator: Alex pushes the glass to the side.
<<jump ContinueStory>>
===

// ================================================================
//  Step 5: Continue the story
// ================================================================

title: ContinueStory
---
Alex: So, how long have you worked here?

-> Few months.
    Alex: You're pretty good for a newcomer.
-> A few years.
    Alex: It shows.

Alex: Well, I'll be back. Same time next week.
Narrator: Alex leaves. Another night at Bar 410.
===
